---
// Phones only: a floating button at the bottom of the screen that switches between the list and the
// calendar (scripts/views/viewSwitch.ts labels it). The view tabs scroll away with the page there. It arrives away
// (.is-away) until the script sees the tabs gone: no flash over the first card.
---

<button class="view-switch is-away" id="view-switch" type="button" data-track="cambiar-vista"></button>
